  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Turismo",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(16 fotos de Man&aacute; Bar, con el men&uacute; y el del Hotel toledo) Este domingo, 24 de julio, acaba la III edici&oacute;n de la guerra de arroces de Hosturionda, en la que participan nueve locales. Si el a&ntilde;o pasado se incluy&oacute; ya la fiedu&agrave;, esta vez tambi&eacute;n hay platos de cocina t&iacute;pica de Onda en los men&uacute;s.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_8730.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">El precio oscila entre 15 y 25 euros, seg&uacute;n locales, y se puede comer dos entrantes y arroz, fideu&agrave; o un plato t&iacute;pico ondense, adem&aacute;s de postre. El caf&eacute; y la bebida va aparte. Consiguiendo el cu&ntilde;o de tres locales, se participa en el sorteo de 9 vales de 20 euros, uno por cada establecimiento participante.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/ManaBarArrossos1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 667px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Entre los locales participantes est&aacute; Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo (al que pertenecen las 14 fotos de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes).&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/ArrossosHotelToledo2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 666px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">Tambi&eacute;n el restaurant del Gran Hotel Toledo, en la calle Argelita, esquina avenida Montendre.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8729.jpg\" alt=\"img_8729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8730.jpg\" alt=\"img_8730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8733.jpg\" alt=\"img_8733\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8736.jpg\" alt=\"img_8736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8737.jpg\" alt=\"img_8737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8740.jpg\" alt=\"img_8740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8745.jpg\" alt=\"img_8745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8747.jpg\" alt=\"img_8747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8750.jpg\" alt=\"img_8750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8756.jpg\" alt=\"img_8756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8759.jpg\" alt=\"img_8759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8762.jpg\" alt=\"img_8762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8763.jpg\" alt=\"img_8763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/img_8765.jpg\" alt=\"img_8765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/arrossoshoteltoledo.jpg\" alt=\"arrossoshoteltoledo\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/arrosmanabar/manabararrossos.jpg\" alt=\"manabararrossos\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
